+# ADR-NEW-review-canary-clean-control
+
+Status: proposed
+Date: Thu 8 Oct 2026
+
+## Context
+
+the maintainer asked that reviewer lanes treat attribution names, fleet machine nicknames,
+documented placeholder home paths, and correct weekday checksums as out of scope
+for OSSPUB-style blocking findings (issue #6017, parent of the review canary).
+
+The NucBoxEVO-X2 host and the agentbox tailnet runner are fleet nicknames, not
+personal identities. Sample fixture audio is stored under `/Users/dev/music/sample.flac`,
+a documented placeholder path from `scripts/oss_tip_rules.py`.
+
+## Decision
+
+No production behavior changes; this file exists only as a clean control for the
+review canary corpus.
